From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kosuke Shibuya <kakiringopcneko@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 17:38:07 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: cfi: reset flash after failed query attempts

Return to array mode after the final CFI query attempt fails. The CFI
probe caller returns without cfi_qry_mode_off() on this path, before
physmap can try its ROM fallback.

Signed-off-by: Kosuke Shibuya <kakiringopcneko@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/mtd/chips/cfi_util.c
+++ b/drivers/mtd/chips/cfi_util.c
@@ -278,6 +278,9 @@ int __xipram cfi_qry_mode_on(uint32_t ba
 	if (cfi_qry_present(map, base, cfi))
 		return 1;
 	/* QRY not found */
+	/* Return the device to array mode after the final query attempt. */
+	cfi_send_gen_cmd(0xF0, 0, base, map, cfi, cfi->device_type, NULL);
+	cfi_send_gen_cmd(0xFF, 0, base, map, cfi, cfi->device_type, NULL);
 	return 0;
 }
 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(cfi_qry_mode_on);
